{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{!--
  To the person who submitted a form with follow-ups on
  (Common/Server/Utils/Form/FormFollowUp): their own link to what they sent,
  where they read its state and its conversation with the team, write to the
  team and add others. The form's name and the request's title are written
  by the form's team and by the submitter, so every line that carries them
  is printed through plainInfo or plainText - escaped - never the raw `info`.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title="We got your request" }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "Your request was sent through " formName ". Use the link below to follow it: see where it stands, read the team's replies, write to them and add others who should follow it.")}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Request" plainText=requestTitle }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=requestUrl buttonText="Open Your Request"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=requestUrl linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{#if isSignInRequired}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Sign in with this email address to open it."}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Keep this email: the link is yours, and anybody who has it can open the request."}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>Did not send this?</strong> Somebody may have typed your address by mistake. You can safely ignore this email."}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
